Protocol documentation credit

The SH-2 / SHTP protocol implemented here is documented by CEVA, Inc.
(formerly Hillcrest Laboratories) in the following public documents:

  1000-3927  BNO08X Datasheet
  1000-3625  SH-2 Reference Manual
  1000-3535  Sensor Hub Transport Protocol
  1000-4044  BNO080/BNO085 Sensor Calibration Procedure
  1000-4045  BNO080/BNO085 Tare Function Usage Guide

This library is an independent, clean implementation of those published
protocols. It contains no CEVA or Bosch source code.
